# Deny by default. Only build manifests and reviewed Python sources enter context.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!requirements.txt
!requirements-container.txt
!requirements-dev.txt
!pyproject.toml
!recebimentos/
!recebimentos/process_extrato/
!recebimentos/process_extrato/**/
!recebimentos/process_extrato/**/*.py
# Defense in depth, including secrets disguised as Python files.
**/.git
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.env*
**/*credential*
**/*secret*
**/*token*
**/*cookie*
**/*profile*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pdf
**/*.PDF
**/*.xlsx
**/*.XLSX
**/*.xls*
**/*.csv
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.db
**/input*
**/output*
**/tmp
**/temp
**/cache*
**/downloads
**/staging
**/raw
**/e
**/s
**/state
**/logs
**/technical_artifacts
**/runs

# Unused source-tree docs/examples; tests generate their own synthetic mappings.
**/*.md
**/*.json
